&lt;h3&gt;2 Go 有异常类型吗？&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="2-go-有异常类型吗"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#2-go-%e6%9c%89%e5%bc%82%e5%b8%b8%e7%b1%bb%e5%9e%8b%e5%90%97" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="此章节的永久链接"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;details class="hx:last-of-type:mb-0 hx:rounded-lg hx:bg-neutral-50 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:p-2 hx:mt-4 hx:group" &gt;
